onomous research subagent. Reads directions, runs experiments, benchmarks results, and commits improvements."}}, {"krn": "krn:kiro-agent-defaults::agent/wf-coder", "layer": "kiro-agent-defaults", "standing": {"kind": "active"}, "value": {"id": "wf-coder", "name": "wf-coder", "description": "Reads files, edits code, runs tests, and commits. General implementation agent."}}, {"krn": "krn:kiro-agent-defaults::agent/wf-design", "layer": "kiro-agent-defaults", "standing": {"kind": "active"}, "value": {"id": "wf-design", "name": "wf-design", "description": "Authors requirements and technical design documents for a feature, exploring the codebase so designs fit existing patterns."}}, {"krn": "krn:kiro-agent-defaults::agent/wf-design-reviewer", "layer": "kiro-agent-defaults", "standing": {"kind": "active"}, "value": {"id": "wf-design-reviewer", "name": "wf-design-reviewer", "description": "Reviews technical designs for ambiguity, gaps, and unverified assumptions before implementation begins. Mechanical verdict: any HIGH/MEDIUM finding blocks."}}, {"krn": "krn:kiro-agent-defaults::agent/wf-planner", "layer": "kiro-agent-defaults", "standing": {"kind": "active"}, "value": {"id": "wf-planner", "name": "wf-planner", "description": "Investigates a codebase and produces an ordered implementation plan \u2014 from an approved design when one is provided, or by making the design decisions itself when not."}}, {"krn": "krn:kiro-agent-defaults::agent/wf-pr-responder", "layer": "kiro-agent-defaults", "standing": {"kind": "active"}, "value": {"id": "wf-pr-responder", "name": "wf-pr-responder", "description": "Responds to PR review comments and CI feedback."}}, {"krn": "krn:kiro-agent-defaults::agent/wf-pr-submitter", "layer": "kiro-agent-defaults", "standing": {"kind": "active"}, "value": {"id": "wf-pr-submitter", "name": "wf-pr-submitter", "description": "Opens a pull request from a branch and records the PR metadata."}}, {"krn": "krn:kiro-agent-defaults::agent/wf-review-aggregator", "